    rdfs:label "Code Table D-9: Significant convective cloud type"@en ;
    dct:description "The items within this code table are the cloud types of operational significance for aviation as specified in ICAO Annex 3 and PANS-MET. This code table contains a subset of the cloud types defined in Part B FM 94 BUFR Code Table 0 20 012."@en ;
